From d3c58976e08d814aedaf524f7247e4ec8feb2cb0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DrakeRamorayJr <179530612+DrakeRamorayJr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:49:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bare: lift the tab sheet off the bottom toolbar and match its
 surface

In bottom-bar Sheet mode the sheet now ends 8dp above the button bar
instead of sitting on it, its bottom corners match the top (20dp), and
the actions row uses the panel's own fill (solid or glass, light and
dark) instead of a separate flat colour, so the two no longer meet in a
hard seam. The travel height and the origin-pill morph account for the
gap. Top-bar Sheet mode and the side drawer are unchanged.
---
 .../browser/bare/BareVerticalTabsDrawer.java  |  50 +++++--
 .../bare/BareVerticalTabsDrawerUnitTest.java  | 126 +++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 163 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

